nt or two to wonder at those marvels."},{"id":"ebfaa296-1e09-4b54-aa72-7bb9f4f4466b","text":"You are the lucky inheritor of a dream come true."}]},{"id":"5a219afb-81d5-4069-adc6-73cae25b8c3e","sentences":[{"id":"c01699ea-dd22-4366-a635-e15245c9af1d","text":"The second half of the 20th century saw a collection of geniuses, warriors, entrepreneurs and visionaries labour to create a fabulous machine that could function as a typewriter and printing press, studio and theatre, paintbrush and gallery, piano and radio, the mail as well as the mail carrier."},{"id":"f187059f-218a-49f0-ad2c-f4d2dbe03f7b","text":"Not only did they develop such a device but by the turn of the millennium they had also managed to embed it in a worldwide system accessed by billions of people every day."},{"id":"5ad3ffb5-beac-4698-a3c3-3b27f7faae15","text":"The networked computer is an amazing device, the first media machine that serves as the mode of production, means of distribution, site of reception, and place of praise and critique."},{"id":"8fb0bde1-386a-463d-ab8d-a7def8ac9e41","text":"The computer is the 21st century’s culture machine."}]},{"id":"bbe583cc-892e-4902-a8cd-8b83afdf9e18","sentences":[{"id":"6d6f6176-d77c-4eff-a166-72af5b764f8a","text":"But for all the reasons there are to celebrate the computer, we must also act with caution."},{"id":"9bf3112b-2b3f-423a-a879-fbd0dc882843","text":"This is because the networked computer has sparked a secret war between downloading and uploading – between passive consumption and active creation – whose outcome will shape our collective future in ways we can only begin to imagine."},{"id":"b032755a-cedf-4c9e-a315-9116c91fddb9","text":"I call it a secret war for two reasons."},{"id":"48743bf1-7f2e-46e1-a8d0-8605f9da1f17","text":"First, most people do not realise that there are strong commercial agendas at work to keep them in passive consumption mode."},{"id":"6c1cfb67-c1b3-4f71-aa53-f856c6dbdd76","text":"Second, the majority of people who use networked computers to upload are not even aware of the significance of what they are doing."}]},{"id":"d2f6613d-5367-4487-a978-3a6c7287c771","sentences":[{"id":"2ea740e1-1634-4f66-ae84-5455fee1ae72","text":"All animals download, but only a few upload."},{"id":"f38b8d1e-c173-4bb7-a387-ca8c0723f818","text":"Beavers build dams and birds make nests."},{"id":"545f7a28-58a2-4a1f-a692-13daa8aab559","text":"Yet for the most part, the animal kingdom moves through the world downloading."},{"id":"659ae7c0-66be-49ae-a40b-9dac30ea51d6","text":"Humans are unique in their capacity to not only make tools but then turn around and use them to create superfluous material goods – paintings, sculpture and architecture – and superfluous experiences – music, literature, religion and philosopy."}]},{"id":"b8b126f8-872e-42f9-aa0e-ca9d0e2ab97c","sentences":[{"id":"ff287349-448a-4070-acc4-07d155ffec66","text":"Of course, it is precisely these superfluous things that define human culture and ultimately what it is to be human."},{"id":"dec6fc9f-1e68-4718-aeb8-b129515d6952","text":"Downloading and consuming culture requires great skills, but failing to move beyond downloading is to strip oneself of a defining constituent of humanity."},{"id":"bcd30ac7-1847-40ee-ac31-df0b7d9b8673","text":"For all the possibilities of our new culture machines, most people are still stuck in download mode."},{"id":"3878d174-b064-4a31-a2c5-ea8df4dad4ad","text":"Even after the advent of widespread social media, a pyramid of production remains, with a small number of people uploading material, a slightly larger group commenting on or modifying that content, and a huge percentage remaining content to just consume."},{"id":"cb8a6458-d1c2-45a0-a63b-0f592bdeb6e8","text":"One reason for the persistence of this pyramid of production is that for the past half-century, much of the world’s media culture has been defined by a single medium – television – and television is defined by downloading."},{"id":"c1c4ea10-e84b-434e-ae11-89c4899b5efb","text":"Television is a one-way tap flowing into our homes."},{"id":"7992f194-d8a0-44ac-a743-2291364e5569","text":"The hardest task that television asks of anyone is to turn the power off after he has turned it on."},{"id":"536e7be1-dd4b-4750-a49e-77465cbb01ec","text":"The networked computer offers the first chance in 50 years to reverse the flow, to encourage thoughtful downloading and, even more importantly, meaningful uploading."},{"id":"0fd8f052-7ec6-423b-ad41-92e9edfd6b5d","text":"What counts as meaningful uploading?"},{"id":"d766efc5-bb47-4f5f-a22d-966847091c3f","text":"My definition revolves around the concept of “stickiness” – creations and experiences to which others adhere."}]}],"sentences":[{"id":"e58a1839-6eb2-4a7a-a07e-3d59145e013e","text":"Think of those fleeting moments when you look out of an aeroplane window and realise that you are flying, higher than a bird."},{"id":"f79319cd-7e6b-4763-ad73-39ae6b340b94","text":"Now think of your laptop, thinner than a brown-paper envelope, or your cellphone in the palm of your hand."},{"id":"57565a48-79c1-44bc-a07a-3e8d12823a32","text":"Take a moment or two to wonder at those marvels."},{"id":"ebfaa296-1e09-4b54-aa72-7bb9f4f4466b","text":"You are the lucky inheritor of a dream come true."},{"id":"c01699ea-dd22-4366-a635-e15245c9af1d","text":"The second half of the 20th century saw a collection of geniuses, warriors, entrepreneurs and visionaries labour to create a fabulous machine that could function as a typewriter and printing press, studio and theatre, paintbrush and gallery, piano and radio, the mail as well as the mail carrier."},{"id":"f187059f-218a-49f0-ad2c-f4d2dbe03f7b","text":"Not only did they develop such a device but by the turn of the millennium they had also managed to embed it in a worldwide system accessed by billions of people every day."},{"id":"5ad3ffb5-beac-4698-a3c3-3b27f7faae15","text":"The networked computer is an amazing device, the first media machine that serves as the mode of production, means of distribution, site of reception, and place of praise and critique."},{"id":"8fb0bde1-386a-463d-ab8d-a7def8ac9e41","text":"The computer is the 21st century’s culture machine."},{"id":"6d6f6176-d77c-4eff-a166-72af5b764f8a","text":"But for all the reasons there are to celebrate the computer, we must also act with caution."},{"id":"9bf3112b-2b3f-423a-a879-fbd0dc882843","text":"This is because the networked computer has sparked a secret war between downloading and uploading – between passive consumption and active creation – whose outcome will shape our collective future in ways we can only begin to imagine."},{"id":"b032755a-cedf-4c9e-a315-9116c91fddb9","text":"I call it a secret war for two reasons."},{"id":"48743bf1-7f2e-46e1-a8d0-8605f9da1f17","text":"First, most people do not realise that there are strong commercial agendas at work to keep them in passive consumption mode."},{"id":"6c1cfb67-c1b3-4f71-aa53-f856c6dbdd76","text":"Second, the majority of people who use networked computers to upload are not even aware of the significance of what they are doing."},{"id":"2ea740e1-1634-4f66-ae84-5455fee1ae72","text":"All animals download, but only a few upload."},{"id":"f38b8d1e-c173-4bb7-a387-ca8c0723f818","text":"Beavers build dams and birds make nests."},{"id":"545f7a28-58a2-4a1f-a692-13daa8aab559","text":"Yet for the most part, the animal kingdom moves through the world downloading."},{"id":"659ae7c0-66be-49ae-a40b-9dac30ea51d6","text":"Humans are unique in their capacity to not only make tools but then turn around and use them to create superfluous material goods – paintings, sculpture and architecture – and superfluous experiences – music, literature, religion and philosopy."},{"id":"ff287349-448a-4070-acc4-07d155ffec66","text":"Of course, it is precisely these superfluous things that define human culture and ultimately what it is to be human."},{"id":"dec6fc9f-1e68-4718-aeb8-b129515d6952","text":"Downloading and consuming culture requires great skills, but failing to move beyond downloading is to strip oneself of a defining constituent of humanity."},{"id":"bcd30ac7-1847-40ee-ac31-df0b7d9b8673","text":"For all the possibilities of our new culture machines, most people are still stuck in download mode."},{"id":"3878d174-b064-4a31-a2c5-ea8df4dad4ad","text":"Even after the advent of widespread social media, a pyramid of production remains, with a small number of people uploading material, a slightly larger group commenting on or modifying that content, and a huge percentage remaining content to just consume."},{"id":"cb8a6458-d1c2-45a0-a63b-0f592bdeb6e8","text":"One reason for the persistence of this pyramid of production is that for the past half-century, much of the world’s media culture has been defined by a single medium – television – and television is defined by downloading."},{"id":"c1c4ea10-e84b-434e-ae11-89c4899b5efb","text":"Television is a one-way tap flowing into our homes."},{"id":"7992f194-d8a0-44ac-a743-2291364e5569","text":"The hardest task that television asks of anyone is to turn the power off after he has turned it on."},{"id":"536e7be1-dd4b-4750-a49e-77465cbb01ec","text":"The networked computer offers the first chance in 50 years to reverse the flow, to encourage thoughtful downloading and, even more importantly, meaningful uploading."},{"id":"0fd8f052-7ec6-423b-ad41-92e9edfd6b5d","text":"What counts as meaningful uploading?"},{"id":"d766efc5-bb47-4f5f-a22d-966847091c3f","text":"My definition revolves around the concept of “stickiness” – creations and experiences to which others adhere."}],"currentSentenceIndex":0,"origin":"system"}'::jsonb,
