study does not answer the question of how much businesses ought to spend on CSR."},{"id":"4d36b69f-d26d-4843-aaf1-d99305be3f34","text":"Nor does it reveal how much companies are banking on the halo effect, rather than the other possible benefits, when they decide their do-gooding policies."},{"id":"eeaad3c5-8ec2-416a-af66-faebaccba391","text":"But at least they have demonstrated that when companies get into trouble with the law, evidence of good character can win them a less costly punishment."}],"currentSentenceIndex":0,"origin":"system"}'::jsonb,
