s idea or invention to make our lives easier."},{"id":"2a419fd1-f2c6-4641-ac9a-5cca6893a955","text":"It gives us patience for ourselves and toward others as well as patience while driving, catching a fish, working on our car, or raising a child."},{"id":"09859693-17bd-49f4-a89b-899523d4fd8a","text":"It allows us to see the beauty that surrounds us each moment in nature, in culture, in the flow of our daily lives."},{"id":"3b868b04-8bbb-4444-a51f-f256df8dacbf","text":"Although mental health is the cure-all for living our lives, it is perfectly ordinary as you will see that it has been there to direct you through all your difficult decisions."},{"id":"eca42fa4-81ef-4fe2-af07-7a8b7d7717d7","text":"It has been available even in the most mundane of life situations to show you right from wrong, good from bad, friend from foe."},{"id":"289d185e-2466-4815-afa9-24fd1d5fdddc","text":"Mental health has commonly been called conscience, instinct, wisdom, common sense, or the inner voice."},{"id":"0395f49a-3285-4d25-a151-82fe5f850df8","text":"We think of it simply as a healthy and helpful flow of intelligent thought."},{"id":"e9f8aaa3-733b-4c53-ac1f-9d8be12c4cc2","text":"As you will come to see, knowing that mental health is always available and knowing to trust it allow us to slow down to the moment and live life happily."}],"currentSentenceIndex":0,"origin":"system"}'::jsonb,
    65,
    true
  )
